  "details": "Prints are on the Player layer (the layer with remote players) and thus show up on anything that captures remote players. Personal Mirrors and Cameras with no way to change that without hiding remote players.\n\nI feel they should be moved to the Pickup layer since they are pickups. I could also see them being moved to the UI layer (for Camera Toggle) but that doesn't make as much sense as the Pickup layer.",
